OL,5,G1800 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FDocumentary profiling a high-speed
OL,7,     Fpolice unit. This edition features
OL,8,     Fsome of the best moments of the
OL,9,     Fseries so far, including the
OL,10,     Fpursuit of a drug dealer.
OL,11,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,12,     FThe officers take drastic action
OL,13,     Fwhen a pursuit from London ends up
OL,14,     Fon their patch; and a car thief
OL,15,     Flands knee-deep in trouble.
OL,16,G2000 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,17,G     Speeders
OL,18,     FIn Newcastle police crack down on
OL,19,     Fdrink and drug drivers and
OL,20,     Funinsured vehicles. And with lives
OL,21,     Fat risk at a crash, officers must
OL,22,     Fseparate the truth from lies.
